      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.73 (up from ₹0.36 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹127.8m (up 48% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.3m (up ₹19.2m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 17% (up from 2.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 112% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 43% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
